### RESTAURANTS

### 1. Get all restaurants
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants

### 2. Get one restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1

### 3. Get open restaurants
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/open

### 4. Create a restaurant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Addis Kitchen",
  "address": "Bole, Addis Ababa",
  "phone": "+251911111222"
}


### DISHES

### 5. Get all dishes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes

### 6. Get one dish
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes/1

### 7. Get dishes for restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes?restaurantId=1

### 8. Create a dish
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "name": "Special Firfir",
  "priceSantim": 20000
}

### 9. Get dishes through restaurant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/dishes


### ORDERS

### 10. Get all orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders

### 11. Get pending orders
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/pending

### 12. Filter by status
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?status=Pending

### 13. Filter by area
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=Bole

### 14. Test pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?limit=5&offset=0

### 15. Sort by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?sort=asc

### 16. Sort by totalSantim descending
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?sort=-totalSantim

### 17. Get one order
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1

### 18. Get orders for restaurant 1
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants/1/orders

### 19. Create an order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customer": "Hana",
  "area": "Bole",
  "teleBirrPhone": "0912345678",
  "lines": [
    {
      "dishId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 20. Update order status
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Confirmed"
}

### 21. Delete order
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/12


### TWELVE INVALID REQUEST TESTS

### 1. Old API route must not be available
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants

### 2. Invalid restaurant body
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "address": ""
}

### 3. Invalid dish restaurant ID
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": -1,
  "name": "Invalid Dish",
  "priceSantim": 15000
}

### 4. Dish references nonexistent restaurant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/dishes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 999,
  "name": "Unknown Restaurant Dish",
  "priceSantim": 15000
}

### 5. Invalid order limit
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?limit=999

### 6. Negative order offset
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?offset=-1

### 7. Invalid order sorting
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?sort=invalid

### 8. Invalid order status filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?status=invalid

### 9. Invalid delivery area
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders?area=Invalid

### 10. Invalid TeleBirr phone
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customer": "Hana",
  "area": "Bole",
  "teleBirrPhone": "12345",
  "lines": [
    {
      "dishId": 1,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 11. Empty order lines
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "customer": "Hana",
  "area": "Bole",
  "lines": []
}

### 12. Invalid order status update
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Invalid"
}